# FEM-SIO - Structured Intent Object

## Role
role: Runtime IR Layer (Brain Intermediate Representation)

## Structure
structure:
  schema/:
    - header.rs
    - intent.rs
    - knowledge.rs
    - ruleset.rs
    - reality.rs
    - runtime.rs
    - context.rs
    - outcome.rs
  builder/:
    - sio_builder.rs
    - packet_merger.rs
    - profile_injector.rs
  validator/:
    - schema_validator.rs
    - authority_validator.rs
    - integrity_validator.rs
  seal/:
    - signer.rs
    - verifier.rs
  serializer/:
    - sio.rs
    - sioz.rs
    - siob.rs

## Brain Contract
contract: |
  pub trait BrainRuntime {
      fn execute(sio: RuntimeSio) -> Result<SioOutcome, RuntimeError>;
  }

